\par To acquire and release the Global Lock:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s15 \fs21\cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard \s15\fi-360\li360\sl-240\slmult0\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls20\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls20
